=20
be lo jeftu .i tu'e ...
ex3) ... ti'o fi I'ySyO'y xi 8601 joi lo sinxa be lo jeftu cu temjudri=20
(se'u) ... (though this usage of ti'o is somehow unexpected in CLL.)

and if once it is declared, you don't need to repeat it in the same=20
context, unless you want to mention a date in another format. Also for the=
=20
other system, you can specify the system as much precisely as you like,=20
